  paragraphs:
    - "Explore the massive estate of this historic Westmoreland Manor just off of McLoughlin Blvd. There's so much hidden in this estate spanning decades of art, books, collectibles and collections. You can find art deco kitchen accessories, Native American art and sculptures, fine art, all kinds of statues and sculptures, vintage robots, musical instruments, model boats and cars, figurines, home decor, Oriental rugs, and thousands upon thousands of books. We even have a FREE baby grand piano! In fact, we also just discovered another wing in the manor with dozens of totes full of more collections and amazing items for sale. This sale is so big we are holding it over 2 weekends!"
